        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hot water tank 600l, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hot water tank 600l, at plant
Production of a chrome steel tank including heat exchanger and boiler. ;
UUID: 505fdfd7-25a7-3d24-84a0-1ce879698ff4
Production and disposal of a hot water tank. Including materials and energy use of production.
Location: Production in CH.
Technology: Hot water tank with 600l for use in a solar collector heating system.
Time period: Materials investigated in 1993. Energy use investigated in 2001.
Production volume: Production volume 1000 units per year. Total production in CH not known.
Sampling: Questionnaires. 
Extrapolations: Data of one factory used for CH. Energy use extrapolated by weight for 2000l storage.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_505fdfd7-25a7-3d24-84a0-1ce879698ff4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
